{"id":"sam_wiki_background_001","npc":"sam","title":"山姆 Sam: background","tags":["sam","identity"],"aliases":["家人","Jodi","Kent","Vincent","brother"],"priority":1,"text":"山姆 Sam 的母亲是乔迪 Jodi，父亲是肯特 Kent，文森特 Vincent 是他的弟弟。父亲是否已经回镇上须依据游戏年份和实际状态。","source_url":"https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Sam","source_section":"Introduction / Relationships","retrieved_at":"2026-09-15","content_kind":"canonical_summary_with_runtime_caveats","review_status":"source_checked_needs_human_review","scope":"base_game"}
